From e35d9ac32b1907d76dd7d441220d182746e4eb7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: git: harden fetched ref integration

Reuse canonical fetched-ref iteration and raw-fetch plumbing, normalize object IDs, preserve accurate cleanup errors, report merged ref conflicts, and avoid shallow-index rebuilds for order-only changes.

